{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">Welcome to a new adventure from the creator of the <i><strong>first Don't Be Afraid game\u2026</strong></i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2420580/extras/7ef0b7b78678325d4ceff611d360c48f.poster.avif?t=1771878032\" width=780 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2420580/extras/7ef0b7b78678325d4ceff611d360c48f.webm?t=1771878032\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2420580/extras/7ef0b7b78678325d4ceff611d360c48f.mp4?t=1771878032\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>You wake up in a place you don\u2019t recognize.</strong><br>You were <strong>taken</strong>.<br>And you are not <strong>alone</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">In <strong>ALYSSA</strong>, you play as a <strong>young girl</strong> trying to escape a <strong>terrifying mansion</strong> filled with <strong>deranged individuals</strong> and <strong>disturbing creations</strong>.\u00a0Along the way, you will meet <strong>Emily</strong> \u2014 a mysterious girl with a mask permanently attached to her face.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">But in a place like this you have to ask yourself:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Can you trust anyone?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2420580/extras/9057c99f00ebd51189bb5c69861a1e23.poster.avif?t=1771878032\" width=780 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2420580/extras/9057c99f00ebd51189bb5c69861a1e23.webm?t=1771878032\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2420580/extras/9057c99f00ebd51189bb5c69861a1e23.mp4?t=1771878032\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">As you <strong>explore</strong>, you\u2019ll uncover fragments of a <strong>dark story</strong> and encounter <strong>entities</strong> that behave in ways you <strong>don\u2019t expect</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Some things are <strong>watching you</strong>.<br>Some things <strong>react to you</strong>.<br>And some should not be <strong>trusted at all</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2420580/extras/0ebfa7a29fcb4338328d1224537b610c.poster.avif?t=1771878032\" width=780 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2420580/extras/0ebfa7a29fcb4338328d1224537b610c.webm?t=1771878032\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2420580/extras/0ebfa7a29fcb4338328d1224537b610c.mp4?t=1771878032\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>ALYSSA</strong> focuses on psychological horror, tension, and vulnerability. You are not a <strong>fighter</strong>.<br>You are being <strong>hunted</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2420580/extras/c989d2ccc441585b2904fc492f8a5b2d.poster.avif?t=1771878032\" width=780 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2420580/extras/c989d2ccc441585b2904fc492f8a5b2d.webm?t=1771878032\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2420580/extras/c989d2ccc441585b2904fc492f8a5b2d.mp4?t=1771878032\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Exploration</strong> plays a key role \u2014 not only to progress further, but also to uncover the many secrets hidden within. Darkness conceals <strong>numerous passages</strong> and <strong>items</strong>\u2026  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2420580/extras/57f667c27065de97643fc343e4145595.webp?t=1771878032\" width=616 height=50 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Story-driven <strong>psychological horror</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Exploration</strong> and <strong>environmental storytelling</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Stealth</strong>-based gameplay</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Multiple endings</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Dark</strong>, oppressive <strong>atmosphere</strong></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2420580?t=1771878032","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2420580/d785ad9f62f1afa19aa765197229d8cccebcf6ab/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1771878032","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2420580/4377b68dd2ba774dbd3f2fe1b4dac02b9c976c07/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1771878032","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2420580/4377b68dd2ba774