nerability. You are not a <strong>fighter</strong>.<br>You are being <strong>hunted</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2420580/extras/c989d2ccc441585b2904fc492f8a5b2d.poster.avif?t=1771878032\" width=780 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2420580/extras/c989d2ccc441585b2904fc492f8a5b2d.webm?t=1771878032\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2420580/extras/c989d2ccc441585b2904fc492f8a5b2d.mp4?t=1771878032\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Exploration</strong> plays a key role \u2014 not only to progress further, but also to uncover the many secrets hidden within. Darkness conceals <strong>numerous passages</strong> and <strong>items</strong>\u2026  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2420580/extras/57f667c27065de97643fc343e4145595.webp?t=1771878032\" width=616 height=50 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Story-driven <strong>psychological horror</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Exploration</strong> and <strong>environmental storytelling</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Stealth</strong>-based gameplay</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Multiple endings</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Dark</strong>, oppressive <strong>atmosphere</strong></p>","developers":["Broken Arrow Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure",